# =============================================================================
# Raw corpora are NOT versioned: 6.1 GB, and every byte is re-downloadable.
#   research/scripts/download_data.py          HF parquet datasets
#   research/scripts/fetch_missing_shards.py   remaining shards (via hf-mirror)
#   research/scripts/xscaffold_download.py     cross-scaffold corpora
#   research/scripts/fetch_gold_patches.py     independent gold patches
#
# What IS versioned: research/data/processed (283 MB) and research/data/annotations,
# so that the five verification gates run immediately after a clone.
# =============================================================================
research/data/raw/
research/data/cache/
research/_cache/

# Python caches and bytecode
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/

# LaTeX intermediates (main.pdf and main.bbl are kept)
paper/*.aux
paper/*.log
paper/*.out
paper/*.blg
paper/*.synctex.gz

# Local secrets — never commit these
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Added 2026-09-13 (round 3). Large DERIVED tables: regenerable from
# research/data/raw via the documented scripts, and too big to version.
#   xscaffold (526 MB) : cross-scaffold step tables
#       -> scripts/xscaffold_*.py against the HF corpora listed in RECON_CORPORA.md
#   live/work* (242 MB): per-episode agent workspaces, rebuilt by prepare_workspace.py
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
research/data/processed/xscaffold/
research/data/live/work/
research/data/live/work48/
research/data/live/*/__pycache__/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Added 2026-09-13 (round 4). Demo caches: a 2.7 KB fitted router and the live
# venv used by the causal experiment.  `python demo/route.py --fit` regenerates
# the first; research/scripts/build_live_venv.ps1 regenerates the second.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
demo/_cache/
research/data/live/.venv/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Added 2026-09-13 (round 6) from the collaborator's branch (`will/dev`).  Their
# macOS block, plus the derived files they identified as regenerable.  The big
# derived tables above stay ignored; the frozen feature tables under
# research/data/processed/steps* stay VERSIONED on purpose, so the six gates run
# immediately after a clone.  Their rule ignoring `processed/steps/` was not
# taken for that reason -- those parquet files are checked in deliberately.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon
._*
.DocumentRevisions-V100
.fseventsd
.Spotlight-V100
.TemporaryItems
.Trashes
.VolumeIcon.icns
.com.apple.timemachine.donotpresent
.AppleDB
.AppleDesktop
Network Trash Folder
Temporary Items
.apdisk
*.icloud
.DS_Store

research/data/processed/windows/
research/data/processed/steps_full/
research/data/processed/tb2/sample_trajectories.jsonl
research/data/processed/nebius/sample_trajectories.jsonl
research/data/processed/tb2/step_embeddings.npz
research/results/final/*/monitor_scores.parquet
research/results/final/*/window_features.parquet
research/results/rebuild/*_w10/window_scores.parquet
research/results/rebuild/step_task.parquet
*.npz
